---
const outcomes = [
  'A short plan, 10–15 pages, with a name next to every job',
  'Laminated "first hour" checklists to keep by the phone',
  'A simple guide to who you have to notify, and by when',
  'A downtime kit so you can keep seeing patients on paper',
  'A short write-up within a week, and a 90-day to-do list with owners',
];
---
<section class="example on-dark" aria-labelledby="example-title">
  <div class="container section-pad layout">
    <div class="story">
      <p class="eyebrow">An example</p>
      <h2 id="example-title" class="h2">Say the computers go down Monday morning. Then what?</h2>
      <p>Most practices have a plan in a binder somewhere. Hardly anybody has practiced it. We write you a short one with a name next to every job, and a backup for when that person's out. Then we sit down with your team for an hour and a half and walk through it like it's really happening.</p>
      <p>At every step we ask the same four things. Who makes the call? Who does what? Who tells staff and patients? And what are your patients going through right now?</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>What you end up with</h3>
      <ul>
        {outcomes.map((item) => (
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5 L10 17 L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .example {
    background: var(--color-dark);
    color: var(--color-on-dark);
  }

  .layout {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .story {
    flex: 1 1 360px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .eyebrow { color: var(--color-on-dark-accent); }

  .h2 {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .story p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--color-on-dark-body);
  }

  .story p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .card {
    flex: 1 1 380px;
    min-width: 0;
    border-color: var(--color-dark-border);
    background: var(--color-dark-card);
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: var(--text-list);
  }

  li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  svg {
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--color-on-dark-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .card { padding: 24px; }
  }
</style>
